---
layout: default
---
<div class="lab-home">
  <section class="lab-hero" aria-labelledby="lab-hero-title">
    <div class="lab-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Muscle physiology · Digital health · Human performance</p>
      <h1 id="lab-hero-title">Researching how people move, adapt, and recover.</h1>
      <p class="lab-hero__lead">
        The Digital Athlete Lab connects muscle physiology, computational biology, digital health, and experiential learning at the University of Calgary.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-actions">
        <a class="lab-button lab-button--primary" href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">Explore our research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="lab-button lab-button--text" href="{{ '/people/' | relative_url }}">Meet the lab <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="lab-hero__mission">People · Movement · Longer, healthier lives</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="lab-hero__media">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/img/prof_pic.jpg' | relative_url }}" alt="Dr. John Holash explaining a force–velocity relationship at a whiteboard">
      <figcaption>
        <strong>Led by Dr. Robert John Holash</strong>
        <span>Faculty of Kinesiology · University of Calgary</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="lab-section" aria-labelledby="research-heading">
    <div class="lab-section__heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What we investigate</p>
        <h2 id="research-heading">Current research</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="lab-arrow-link" href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">View all research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-feature-grid">
      <a class="lab-feature-card" href="{{ '/projects/2024-08-15-fatigue-modeling-cp/' | relative_url }}">
        <div class="lab-feature-card__image"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/muscle-fatigue-testing.webp' | relative_url }}" alt="Illustration of skeletal muscle structure and physiological testing"></div>
        <div class="lab-feature-card__body"><span>Muscle physiology</span><h3>Muscle structure and function</h3><p>Understanding force, fatigue, and adaptation from the sarcomere to human movement.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="lab-feature-card" href="{{ '/projects/2024-10-01-activation-health-platform/' | relative_url }}">
        <div class="lab-feature-card__image"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/activation_project.jpg' | relative_url }}" alt="ACTIVATION Health mobile research platform and participant dashboard"></div>
        <div class="lab-feature-card__body"><span>Digital health</span><h3>ACTIVATION Health</h3><p>Measuring mobility, activity, and recovery beyond the clinic and laboratory.</p></div>
      </a>
      <a class="lab-feature-card" href="{{ '/projects/2023-06-20-melt-study/' | relative_url }}">
        <div class="lab-feature-card__image"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/andrew_filewich_melt_poster_graphic.png' | relative_url }}" alt="Students using multimedia resources during exercise physiology laboratory training"></div>
        <div class="lab-feature-card__body"><span>Teaching innovation</span><h3>Learning through experience</h3><p>Pairing precise multimedia preparation with hands-on scientific practice.</p></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lab-section lab-stories" aria-labelledby="stories-heading">
    <div class="lab-section__heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Research, students, and ideas</p><h2 id="stories-heading">Latest from the lab</h2></div>
      <a class="lab-arrow-link" href="{{ '/blog/' | relative_url }}">View all stories <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-story-list">
      {% for post in site.posts limit: 3 %}
        <a class="lab-story" href="{{ post.url | relative_url }}">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | date_to_xmlschema }}">{{ post.date | date: '%b %d, %Y' }}</time>
          <div><h3>{{ post.title }}</h3>{% if post.description %}<p>{{ post.description }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
          <span class="lab-story__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lab-home-note">
    <p>Better movement.<br>Healthier lives.</p>
    <div><strong>Digital Athlete Lab</strong><span>Human Performance Laboratory · Faculty of Kinesiology · University of Calgary</span></div>
  </section>
</div>
